          "speech_start_seconds": 0.08,
          "speech_end_seconds": 4.97,
          "reuse_of": null
        },
        {
          "id": "H02_BRIEF_001",
          "text": "The complaint is about the inspection lamp. Just that lamp.",
          "voice": "dale",
          "file": "H02_BRIEF_001.wav",
          "asset": "v_H02_BRIEF_001",
          "raw": "voice/horror/H02_BRIEF_001.wav",
          "duration": 3.14,
          "frames": 150720,
          "sha256": "84136c78560acef0e171a7e3e67eb1303b4fb852ad0f077bc1545b40bbba3636",
          "speech_start_seconds": 0.08,
          "speech_end_seconds": 2.87,
          "reuse_of": null
        },
        {
          "id": "H02_BRIEF_002",
          "text": "Use the marked service control outside the fence. Leave the locked equipment alone.",
          "voice": "dale",
          "file": "H02_BRIEF_002.wav",
          "asset": "v_H02_BRIEF_002",
          "raw": "voice/horror/H02_BRIEF_002.wav",
          "duration": 4.44,
          "frames": 213120,
          "sha256": "11b3f0856cfc6b3d827e307ada1e7df88907701c2866b0caf3ba8b9a5f167177",
          "speech_start_seconds": 0.08,
          "speech_end_seconds": 4.23,
          "reuse_of": null
        },
        {
          "id": "H02_BRIEF_003",
          "text": "Watch the lamp and the indicator separately. Tell me whether they agree.",
          "voice": "dale",
          "file": "H02_BRIEF_003.wav",
          "asset": "v_H02_BRIEF_003",
          "raw": "voice/horror/H02_BRIEF_003.wav",
          "duration": 3.94,
          "frames": 189120,
          "sha256": "d9647199e233c8f1d4fab871b55755cd6cf6f59d9b505782b5692451f1b8473a",
          "speech_start_seconds": 0.08,
          "speech_end_seconds": 3.73,
          "reuse_of": null
        },
        {
          "id": "H04_BRIEF_001",
          "text": "The service drawer has a spare. Brass tag, OFFICE. I should have put it in the handover.",
          "voice": "dale",
          "file": "H04_BRIEF_001.wav",
          "asset": "v_H04_BRIEF_001",
          "raw": "voice/horror/H04_BRIEF_001.wav",
          "duration": 4.6,
          "frames": 220800,
          "sha256": "b915931dd378db74b463649ae606da26e1f6bcb55b38be4303f607cfd1f3f618",
          "speech_start_seconds": 0.1,
          "speech_end_seconds": 4.43,
          "reuse_of": null
        },
        {
          "id": "H04_BRIEF_002",
          "text": "Take the field folder. I wrote down where I stood so somebody else could try it.",
          "voice": "dale",
          "file": "H04_BRIEF_002.wav",
          "asset": "v_H04_BRIEF_002",
          "raw": "voice/horror/H04_BRIEF_002.wav",
          "duration": 4.39,
